;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\五島桃子子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\五島子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"I'm sorry, <STYLE ID="1">she</STYLE> must have been a bother..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, no, our </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> seemed to have fun too. I should be thanking you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Come on, <STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE>, we're going home."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Goodbye, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! </STYLE>Momoko-chan<STYLE ID="3">! Bye-byeee!"</STYLE><PG>
Her apparent older sister<STYLE ID="4"> held her hand as they went home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">She looked like she was still in elementary school, but she was such a polite, capable </STYLE>older sister<STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Again I put </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> on my shoulders and we headed home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That was fun, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">My whole body still stung as if I'd been skinned.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I could never let </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> eat something like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">For the time being, what's-it-called takoyaki was banned in the Kogori household.</STYLE> [TN: takoyaki: fried batter balls with octopus inside]<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">While I was holed up in the bathroom, that </STYLE>genius girl's older sister<STYLE ID="4"> had apparently looked after </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and the other girl.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">She'd ordered the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="いた">stir-fried</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> spinach and the salad in my place, and seemed to have done everything from feeding them to keeping them company.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Taking care of not just </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> but the </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">genius girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too, so briskly. That </STYLE>older sister<STYLE ID="4"> must be a smart kid as well.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... I wondered if she was all right.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s letter...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm home!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "500" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> came into the house and ran to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, here, I brought you something!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Guess what, guess what, today there was a girl called </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　And then the Russian-roulette takoyaki―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">? I feel like I've heard that somewhere..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Happily giving her report on Zahha: </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Watching her with eyes full of love: </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm going to give </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> her bath. Read that letter while I'm doing it."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">With that, the two of them went off to the bathroom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">If she was having me read it too, it really wasn't just an ordinary letter.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手紙.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">The letter had been left on the table.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I sat down on a chair and looked at the letter.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, it has been a long time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I am sorry for this sudden letter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, I have taken up my pen because there is something I would like to ask your advice about.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is what I am writing about.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, after she started elementary school, defended a classmate who was being bullied, and for that reason now </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is the one being bullied.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> is considerate of me and does not say she is being bullied, and she says school is fun.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">I talked to her teacher, but however much the teacher looked into it, no evidence was found.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">In other words, as far as the school is concerned, there is no bullying.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">It seems the PTA is involved, so they cannot look into it deeply.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I tried to press them, but in my present state of mind, unfortunately, there are limits.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Is there not some way to help </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">? I cannot bear to watch </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> any longer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">This letter alone may not convey it, but I am even considering dying together.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Childhood friends or not, I know I am being selfish, asking this after not being in touch all this time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">If you are willing to respond in any way, please come to the return address on this letter tomorrow, April 7, at 22:00.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">This is where we live now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Please do not reply by phone, email or letter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I do not want anyone else to know about this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I do not want to leave any evidence at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">If you refuse, please simply ignore this.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">When you come here, I will tell you how it will be done.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I would like a man's help, so if possible, please have </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> come too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I will prepare everything you need here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">The targets are the two people in the enclosed photographs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">The targets' names and addresses are written on the backs of the photographs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Do not worry. Whatever happens, the police will never be able to reach you.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">I have made that much preparation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">What was this letter...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s two bullies were to be stopped. That much I understood.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But then there was the wording: 'leave no evidence,' 'the police,' 'targets.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was telling us to kill the two bullies?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And if we couldn't, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> would die together...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">This left us no choice at all!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">She was telling us to kill kids about the same age as </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!? Give me a break!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">No, my reaction was too rash.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had sent this letter knowing we'd think that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">She was that cornered, and there was that much trust between </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was our daughter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Dying together did feel like an exaggeration, but there was no way I could ignore it...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">―The time reached 21:30, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> seemed to be asleep.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, did you read it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Across from me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s face was dark, as I'd expected.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So this means </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wants us to take the two bullies and..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s thinking, it seemed, she read the same way I did.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But think about it normally. It's just bullying between elementary schoolers, and to kill over that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s a big baby at heart, but when it comes to her family, she pushes herself too hard..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... there have to be plenty of other ways. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Have Haruka change schools, or come back to Motoki-cho... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And if that's impossible, go to Arata..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s a big baby and a coward, but she's not stupid. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">She must have thought through every option we could think of. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So changing schools and going to Arata are both impossible... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Above all, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> puts her family before everything... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That's why I think she arrived at a choice like this."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what do you want to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Of course I want to help her... I want to help </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> too, no matter what, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">So she couldn't give an answer right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But either way, we'd have to go to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s place tomorrow at 22:00.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">If we didn't go, they might die together.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">If we could meet her in person, talk, and somehow persuade her...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, either way, we're going to Megasawa tomorrow. We'll meet her and talk in person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There has to be another option still."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"You're right. All right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Megasawa was about 3 hours away by car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">If we got ready now, leaving after work tomorrow would give us plenty of time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"What do we do about </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Have </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> parents look after her. The </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="とのさき">Tonosaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> place is on the way to Megasawa. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Just tell them there's been a sudden death in the family."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"All right, I'll call them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">With that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> picked up the phone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, wait. She said no phone calls or letters. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That goes for anyone we contact about this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Even this letter, if you look closely, has no postmark."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">No postmark meant </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> really had delivered this letter without leaving a single trace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Then how had this letter been delivered?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then I'll tell my mom from a public phone tomorrow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That's all right, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Well, that should be fine. There was no direct connection to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had said she'd make sure nothing could be traced back to us.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">No, what am I thinking!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">We're going to persuade her! Not to kill anyone!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">We finished getting ready for tomorrow and went to bed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Tomorrow, we go to Megasawa.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">We're the cause of all this, and we're going to settle it properly.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
